@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminAuthorization = Basic SUBSTITUA_POR_BASE64_DE_EMAIL_DOIS_PONTOS_SENHA

### Checkout - sucesso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usr": "Guilherme",
